WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.524
Today we will revise a work thoughtfully. Our work connects with international

00:00:04.524 --> 00:00:06.685
artists and communities around the world.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:10.669
Read or listen to one helpful comment on the draft.

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:14.456
Choose one change that supports the artwork’s purpose.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:20.815
Make the change and explain how the second version improved. Justify a revision using

00:00:20.815 --> 00:00:22.701
evidence from another world tradition.
